# A glyph without instructions in a face with a font program: the default
# load scales its points and the phantom points, and grid-fits the metrics,
# with no instruction moving a point.
heights 16384 1000 700
fpgm
  PUSH 0; FDEF; ENDF
end
glyph advance 1100
  contour 100 0, 100 1400, 900 1400 off, 900 0
end
